  "ja260:1.1": "",
  "ja260:1.2": "yācituṃ ",
  "ja260:1.3": "tass' ūdarass' ahaṃ dūto, ",
  "ja260:1.4": "mā me kujjhi rathesabha. ",
  "ja260:2.1": "Yassa divā ca ratto ca ",
  "ja260:2.2": "vasam āyanti māṇavā ",
  "ja260:2.3": "tass' ūdarass' ahaṃ dūto, ",
  "ja260:2.4": "mā me kujjhi rathesabhāti. ",
  "ja260:3.1": "Dadāmi te brāhmaṇa rohiṇīnaṃ ",
  "ja260:3.2": "gavaṃ sahassaṃ saha puṅgavena, ",
  "ja260:3.3": "dūto hi dūtassa kathaṃ na dajjā, ",
  "ja260:3.4": "mayam pi tass' eva bhavāma dūtāti. ",
